<h1>Conference & Event Venue</h1>

<p>Our on-site Conference & Event Venue is perfect for corporate meetings, seminars, workshops, and social events.</p>

<% if @facility && @facility.persisted? %>
  <h2><%= @facility.name %></h2>
  <p><%= simple_format(@facility.description) %></p>
<% else %>
  <p><strong>Capacity:</strong> Flexible setups for small board meetings to large seminars.</p>
  <p><strong>Tech-Ready:</strong> Projector, premium sound system, and wireless microphones.</p>
  <p><strong>Connectivity:</strong> High-speed Wi-Fi for presentations and streaming.</p>
  <p><strong>Catering:</strong> Customizable catering packages from our rooftop restaurant.</p>
<% end %>

<p><%= link_to "Book a venue", new_booking_path %></p>
